WEBVTT

00:18.143 --> 00:18.977
Ready.

00:22.939 --> 00:25.233
Today, I'll settle everything.

00:30.363 --> 00:33.241
I'm coming for you, Taiju.

00:37.078 --> 00:38.163
Listen up, men!

00:41.916 --> 00:45.795
Today, me and Koko will be
in charge of BLACK DRAGON.

00:50.759 --> 00:53.219
Boss, we'll be going now.

00:55.346 --> 00:56.181
Right.

01:14.824 --> 01:17.368
I wish... it would all just end.

01:33.051 --> 01:35.595
Looks like
we're going to be pretty busy today.

01:36.846 --> 01:37.889
What do you want to do,

01:38.389 --> 01:39.224
Koko?

01:41.017 --> 01:41.851
Isn't it obvious?

01:42.352 --> 01:45.021
I'm sticking with you, Inupi.

01:48.733 --> 01:50.235
Keeping your promise?

01:50.318 --> 01:51.152
Huh?

01:57.200 --> 01:58.868
I forgot all about that.

02:10.505 --> 02:12.841
TOKYO REVENGERS

03:49.979 --> 03:51.773
The hell did you say, asshole?

03:51.856 --> 03:54.234
I dare you to say that again!

03:55.735 --> 03:58.321
You're just an ass-kisser to the Captain!

03:58.404 --> 04:02.033
You joined after we did,
so quit acting so cocky, Matsuno!

04:02.116 --> 04:04.661
And you're a year younger than us--

04:04.744 --> 04:05.578
You bastard!

04:09.457 --> 04:10.291
Holy shit!

04:10.375 --> 04:11.834
You asshole!

04:11.918 --> 04:13.419
You cocky son of a--

04:24.138 --> 04:25.014
Pissant!

04:25.098 --> 04:26.808
You'll never beat me!

04:36.401 --> 04:37.235
It's Baji!

04:38.444 --> 04:39.320
Captain!

04:41.364 --> 04:43.074
What the hell are you guys doing?

04:44.033 --> 04:45.326
-Good evening!
-Good evening!

05:14.480 --> 05:15.523
Holy crap!

05:34.751 --> 05:36.502
Don't cause trouble in the division.

05:37.503 --> 05:39.047
But those assholes...

05:39.714 --> 05:43.801
You're not
all on your own anymore, Chifuyu.

05:45.053 --> 05:48.389
I joined Toman because I admire you, Baji!

05:49.432 --> 05:52.185
But you don't respect any of the others?

05:53.061 --> 05:53.978
Right!

05:56.939 --> 05:57.940
In that case,

05:59.400 --> 06:01.194
only follow me.

06:06.991 --> 06:08.910
You just got to stick with me.

06:11.162 --> 06:11.996
Yes, Sir!

06:13.122 --> 06:15.750
FIRST DIVISION CAPTAIN

06:29.347 --> 06:31.057
<i>Today's the day of the battle.</i>

06:32.225 --> 06:34.602
<i>Our goal is to stop Hakkai
from killing Taiju</i>

06:34.685 --> 06:36.521
<i>and to crush BLACK DRAGON.</i>

06:37.230 --> 06:40.274
<i>If this succeeds,
the future will be better this time!</i>

06:40.900 --> 06:41.943
Takemitchy!

06:52.537 --> 06:53.913
Tokyo Manji Gang,

06:53.996 --> 06:57.417
First Division Vice-Captain,
Chifuyu Matsuno!

06:58.960 --> 07:03.673
Born in Shibuya Ward, Tokyo, in 1991,

07:04.173 --> 07:07.218
I lived a life of hating
and hurting others!

07:08.052 --> 07:11.848
The person who changed that
was a man named Keisuke Baji!

07:15.643 --> 07:19.522
He was a great man who stuck
to his ideals through thick and thin!

07:19.605 --> 07:22.525
This is Keisuke Baji's sash!

07:23.985 --> 07:25.736
I entrust it to you!

07:27.071 --> 07:28.030
Thank you.

07:40.460 --> 07:43.004
I accept the baton, Chifuyu!

07:45.423 --> 07:49.594
Tokyo Manji Gang, First Division Captain,
Takemichi Hanagaki!

07:50.219 --> 07:51.888
Having accepted this sash,

07:52.388 --> 07:56.309
I swear
that I will live true to my ideals!

08:04.317 --> 08:05.526
All warmed up now.

08:05.610 --> 08:06.444
Yes!

08:12.283 --> 08:13.993
<i>We can't rely on Mikey this time.</i>

08:15.870 --> 08:18.706
<i>Nor Draken nor Mitsuya.</i>

08:20.583 --> 08:22.293
<i>We can't rely on anyone else in Toman.</i>

08:33.638 --> 08:35.264
<i>Only the four of us can fight this battle.</i>

08:37.058 --> 08:38.226
<i>Into battle, we go!</i>

08:45.566 --> 08:46.484
So, this is the place.

08:47.777 --> 08:49.695
Stick to the plan, okay?

08:50.530 --> 08:53.199
Yeah. I'll convince Hakkai.

08:53.783 --> 08:55.034
He's probably already inside.

08:55.535 --> 08:57.828
You guys hold back Taiju here.

08:59.664 --> 09:00.540
Takemitchy.

09:01.249 --> 09:03.501
Stopping Taiju is important,

09:03.584 --> 09:08.005
but our future will only change
if you can change Hakkai's mind.

09:08.089 --> 09:08.923
Right.

09:11.551 --> 09:12.468
I'm counting on you!

09:12.969 --> 09:15.388
Got it. Leave this to me!

09:21.894 --> 09:23.312
FIRST DIVISION CAPTAIN

09:50.381 --> 09:51.299
<i>There he is!</i>

09:53.384 --> 09:54.468
Hakkai!

09:57.597 --> 09:58.514
Takemitchy!

09:59.015 --> 10:00.099
What're you doing here?

10:00.850 --> 10:03.102
I figured you would be here, Hakkai.

10:07.189 --> 10:08.566
What's this all about?

10:09.942 --> 10:11.527
I'm here to stop you.

10:12.820 --> 10:19.452
<i>I hate to admit it, but if Hakkai's here,
that means Kisaki's prediction was right.</i>

10:20.244 --> 10:23.205
<i>And Taiju will be
approaching this church too.</i>

10:23.289 --> 10:28.210
<i>So, while Kisaki and the others
hold up Taiju outside,</i>

10:28.294 --> 10:29.879
<i>I just need to convince Hakkai!</i>

10:31.088 --> 10:32.506
Takemitchy.

10:33.549 --> 10:35.468
I didn't have that talk with you

10:35.551 --> 10:37.428
because I wanted you to stop me.

10:39.138 --> 10:40.473
It was to stiffen my resolve!

10:41.474 --> 10:43.934
If you get in my way, I'll kill you too!

10:46.187 --> 10:47.313
That's a lie.

10:47.396 --> 10:48.230
Huh?

10:48.981 --> 10:52.610
I only tell people about my troubles
when I can't make up my mind.

10:54.195 --> 10:57.073
Hakkai, I understand how you feel.

10:57.156 --> 11:00.034
Taiju's so tyrannical,
you've got no alternative.

11:01.410 --> 11:03.371
You think your only choice is to kill him.

11:04.622 --> 11:09.251
But choosing to murder
won't lead to protecting others.

11:11.295 --> 11:14.215
You want to protect your sister,
Yuzuha, right?

11:14.298 --> 11:15.132
Hakkai!

11:15.800 --> 11:17.468
You just don't understand!

11:22.348 --> 11:24.225
If the food tastes bad, he hits me.

11:24.934 --> 11:28.145
If I forget to greet him right,
he forces me to kneel all day long.

11:29.605 --> 11:33.234
If I don't get up before he does,
he kicks me until I cough up blood.

11:33.734 --> 11:37.321
When he's in a bad mood,
he beats me just for looking at him!

11:38.614 --> 11:39.699
That's life in the Shiba home.

11:41.701 --> 11:43.828
Keep your nose
out of my family's business!

11:46.122 --> 11:47.039
Get out!

11:48.374 --> 11:50.167
You cannot stop me!

11:53.754 --> 11:55.381
I told you to get out!

11:55.464 --> 11:56.298
Yesterday...

11:57.967 --> 11:59.427
Yesterday, I broke up with Hina.

12:02.304 --> 12:05.766
I broke up with her... to protect her.

12:08.936 --> 12:11.605
I'm weak and I'm gutless.

12:12.523 --> 12:13.858
And I'm a total idiot.

12:15.109 --> 12:18.070
But she still loves me,
so I would do absolutely anything

12:18.779 --> 12:20.072
to protect her.

12:23.033 --> 12:25.703
But I'd never kill anyone!

12:26.662 --> 12:30.750
No matter how much I hate them
or how impossible the alternatives are,

12:31.250 --> 12:35.379
I would never do anything
that would make Hina grieve!

12:36.630 --> 12:37.798
Listen to me, Hakkai!

12:38.466 --> 12:40.760
Is that what you want to do to Yuzuha?

12:42.052 --> 12:46.140
Don't you think Yuzuha would grieve
if you committed murder?!

12:48.058 --> 12:49.018
Takemitchy...

13:00.946 --> 13:01.906
What?

13:03.783 --> 13:06.368
Our Father who art in heaven...

13:10.080 --> 13:13.501
I pray in thy holy name.

13:22.301 --> 13:23.594
<i>What's Taiju doing here?</i>

13:24.136 --> 13:25.262
Where's Kisaki and the others?

13:26.555 --> 13:29.975
What the hell are you two doing here?

13:31.519 --> 13:32.728
What happened?

13:37.817 --> 13:38.651
Hakkai!

13:39.735 --> 13:41.278
Stop, Hakkai!

13:54.333 --> 13:56.627
What a freaking pain in the ass.

13:59.672 --> 14:02.299
Stay out of this fight between brothers.

14:10.683 --> 14:11.809
Oh, well.

14:12.518 --> 14:14.979
I guess the Hanmas team is through.

14:16.564 --> 14:18.649
So, we were called "Hanmas"?

14:20.192 --> 14:23.112
So hey, I didn't want to ask this before,

14:23.904 --> 14:26.240
but you were going to backstab them
from the start, right?

14:27.283 --> 14:29.743
So, why'd we work with them?

14:30.244 --> 14:31.620
Because it's fun.

14:32.246 --> 14:33.080
Huh?

14:34.790 --> 14:38.627
I mean, those guys couldn't do
a goddamn thing about it.

14:41.589 --> 14:43.757
You're the best, Kisaki.

14:43.841 --> 14:47.469
You're the only guy
who knows how to entertain me.

14:54.143 --> 14:57.354
For you, it's always just an act.

15:01.108 --> 15:04.612
I'd gotten my hopes up
that you'd actually try to kill me.

15:06.572 --> 15:08.616
This is hard on me, Hakkai.

15:09.450 --> 15:12.286
You've let me down once again.

15:15.372 --> 15:17.374
If you're serious about it, don't shout.

15:18.083 --> 15:20.002
Stab me quietly from behind.

15:20.920 --> 15:22.504
<i>If Taiju's here,</i>

15:23.213 --> 15:25.466
<i>that means Kisaki and Hanma betrayed us!</i>

15:25.549 --> 15:26.550
<i>Chifuyu!</i>

15:27.885 --> 15:28.719
<i>But wait...</i>

15:29.303 --> 15:32.264
<i>We stopped Hakkai
from killing his brother!</i>

15:32.765 --> 15:36.393
<i>Could this mean...
I've accomplished my mission?</i>

15:37.394 --> 15:40.272
<i>No! Now Hakkai's in trouble!</i>

15:44.818 --> 15:46.028
Stop it!

15:47.029 --> 15:50.032
<i>What'll I do? Can I actually stop Taiju?</i>

15:50.532 --> 15:52.409
<i>But if I don't do something...</i>

15:56.330 --> 15:58.123
Takemichi Hanagaki.

15:59.333 --> 16:03.420
This is the second time you've interfered
with Shiba family affairs!

16:24.274 --> 16:25.567
Hakkai.

16:26.151 --> 16:29.029
My back is wide open.

16:32.658 --> 16:35.327
<i>He's goading Hakkai... But why?</i>

16:42.501 --> 16:45.671
Before, I punched you
with only 30% of my power.

16:45.754 --> 16:49.299
Since this is the second time,
I'm using 50%. Understand?

16:49.883 --> 16:51.510
Hurts like hell, doesn't it?

16:54.346 --> 16:56.932
<i>I... can't move.</i>

16:57.558 --> 17:00.519
<i>I've been punched
by lots of different people before,</i>

17:01.103 --> 17:02.771
<i>but Taiju's on a different level!</i>

17:07.317 --> 17:08.402
<i>He's going to kill me!</i>

17:09.903 --> 17:11.864
What's the matter, Hakkai?

17:12.573 --> 17:14.408
Aren't you going to save him?

17:15.784 --> 17:18.328
If you're not, then I'll finish him off.

17:18.412 --> 17:19.830
Ha... Hakkai...

17:21.123 --> 17:23.167
Takemichi Hanagaki!

17:26.211 --> 17:29.715
Do you know why Hakkai wants to kill me?

17:32.426 --> 17:36.430
'Cause you... abuse Yuzuha!

17:43.103 --> 17:44.605
Did you hear that, Hakkai?

17:47.691 --> 17:50.319
Maybe I should tell him your secret.

17:51.111 --> 17:51.987
<i>Secret?</i>

17:53.322 --> 17:56.867
Hakkai isn't the guy you think he is.

17:57.868 --> 17:58.952
Don't!

17:59.036 --> 18:00.412
He's--

18:00.496 --> 18:02.331
Don't!

18:04.541 --> 18:05.375
Yuzuha?

18:15.928 --> 18:18.639
<i>Yuzuha... stabbed Taiju?</i>

18:32.027 --> 18:33.237
Yuzuha...

18:34.404 --> 18:36.573
You bitch!

18:39.827 --> 18:42.496
Now you've really done it!

18:49.837 --> 18:50.671
Yuzuha...

18:51.213 --> 18:52.172
What...

18:52.256 --> 18:53.465
What're you doing here?

18:55.008 --> 18:56.635
I came to save you!

18:58.595 --> 19:00.389
I'll end this whole thing!

19:01.807 --> 19:03.058
Why...

19:03.725 --> 19:05.686
Why did you come?

19:06.854 --> 19:08.522
Takemitchy!

19:09.231 --> 19:11.692
Goddamn you! You told Yuzuha, didn't you?

19:12.192 --> 19:15.279
You're the only one I told
about what I decided to do!

19:15.362 --> 19:18.157
What? I never told her a thing!

19:18.240 --> 19:21.451
That's right.
Hanagaki didn't tell me anything.

19:22.786 --> 19:24.538
I heard about it from Tetta Kisaki.

19:25.122 --> 19:25.956
Kisaki?

19:27.040 --> 19:27.875
What?

19:29.751 --> 19:30.961
<i>Hold on here!</i>

19:32.254 --> 19:35.132
<i>That must mean
Kisaki incited Yuzuha to do it!</i>

19:36.675 --> 19:41.346
<i>Could it be that in the original timeline
Hakkai didn't kill Taiju?</i>

19:45.058 --> 19:46.560
<i>I thought something was odd.</i>

19:47.186 --> 19:50.814
<i>I hadn't done a thing,
but Hakkai failed to kill Taiju!</i>

19:51.815 --> 19:56.862
<i>So, in the original timeline,
Hakkai didn't kill Taiju!</i>

19:57.446 --> 19:59.573
<i>And it was Yuzuha who stabbed Taiju!</i>

20:00.282 --> 20:04.578
<i>In the original timeline,
the person who killed Taiju was Yuzuha!</i>

20:06.622 --> 20:09.124
<i>Oh, shit! Shit!</i>

20:09.708 --> 20:10.876
<i>I didn't prevent it!</i>

20:11.960 --> 20:16.173
<i>The wound Taiju got when he was stabbed
from behind must have been fatal!</i>

20:18.842 --> 20:19.718
Shit!

20:24.723 --> 20:27.392
You screwed up, Yuzuha.

20:28.936 --> 20:30.979
You did good

20:31.063 --> 20:34.983
to sneak up silently and
throw all your weight into your thrust.

20:35.692 --> 20:37.653
But I had a split second to move

20:38.153 --> 20:41.114
thanks to Hanagaki's shout.

20:43.533 --> 20:45.118
It's Hanagaki you should blame.

20:47.329 --> 20:48.580
<i>The wound is shallow!</i>

20:49.289 --> 20:53.043
<i>Which means I saved him? No way!</i>

20:53.126 --> 20:57.589
<i>Then, that must mean the future
where Kisaki controls Hakkai is avoided!</i>

21:00.801 --> 21:02.594
How sad.

21:03.512 --> 21:04.596
Hakkai.

21:05.180 --> 21:06.390
Yuzuha.

21:08.016 --> 21:11.812
You tried to kill
your own biological brother.

21:15.649 --> 21:19.695
Your own family
who has slaved to the bone for you!

21:20.612 --> 21:21.446
You're wrong!

21:22.364 --> 21:24.324
You only work for yourself.

21:24.992 --> 21:26.952
You couldn't care less about us!

21:28.120 --> 21:31.665
You've used the word "family"
as a way to manipulate us!

21:32.582 --> 21:33.792
You used us!

21:34.293 --> 21:35.794
You're a monster!

21:40.632 --> 21:42.634
Yuzuha...

21:47.431 --> 21:48.265
Yuzuha!

21:48.348 --> 21:50.600
That's brutal! Your own sister?

21:51.310 --> 21:53.228
<i>He seriously punched her!</i>

21:53.312 --> 21:54.563
Dear Lord,

21:55.188 --> 21:58.400
why does God
always put me through such ordeals?

22:03.363 --> 22:08.660
Why must I kill
my own beloved little sister?

23:38.333 --> 23:40.335
Translation by Brian Athey
